# Clay model-driven development

This repo is generated with [Clay](https://morkeleb.github.io/clay/). The domain model and generators are the source of truth; generated outputs are disposable.

## Do

- Edit `clay/model.json` (and includes/mixins under `clay/`) to change domain shape
- Edit templates and `generator.json` under `clay/generators/`
- Regenerate with `clay generate` or Clay MCP `clay_generate`
- Prefer Clay MCP tools (`clay_model_query`, `clay_model_add`, `clay_model_update`, `clay_generate`) when changing the model

## Do not

- Hand-edit files tracked in `.clay` → `generated_files`
- "Quick fix" generated code — change the model or template, then regenerate
- Delete generated files to "clean up" unless using `clay clean` / `clay generate` reconciliation

## If a hook blocks an edit

A pre-tool-use hook denied the write because the path is Clay-owned. Update the model/template and regenerate instead.
